{"id":"dt","type":"text","x":362,"y":122,"width":316,"height":146,"text":"① 发现页 discovery — 侦察 / 广撒网\n· 软搜索关键词 (in-SPA) + 浏览推荐流\n· 点赞少量 · 收藏精选\n· 页面 feed 流量被动写入热门池","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"d"},

