{"id":"ct","type":"text","x":782,"y":552,"width":316,"height":146,"text":"② 评论区 comment_section — 采集 / 截流\n· 读热门池里的笔记 + 翻页评论\n· 采集评论者 → 线索池 (此处不关注)\n· 可点赞 / 回复评论 (受控)","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"c"},

{"id":"p","type":"rectangle","x":20,"y":540,"width":340,"height":170,"strokeColor":"#0c8599","backgroundColor":"#99e9f2","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"id":"pt","type":"text"}]},
{"id":"pt","type":"text","x":32,"y":552,"width":316,"height":146,"text":"③ 主页 profile — 深耕 / 转化\n· 排空线索池 (最久未访问优先)\n· 关注 owner + 浏览其笔记\n· 点赞/收藏/评论 (受控) · 标记 seen","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"p"},

